{"ok": true, "summary": "Built an interactive whole-vehicle thermal-management schematic for an electric SUV, including the underfloor battery cold plate, front e-drive and oil cooler, integrated coolant module, cabin HVAC, front heat exchangers, compressor, chiller, expansion valves and auxiliary heater. Animated coolant and refrigerant paths switch between parallel cooling and series waste-heat recovery across the requested operating modes. Numbered hotspots, sectional visibility and staged narration support system review. Component geometry uses illustrative proportions; the optional transparent vehicle shell is a generic packaging reference, not an SUV dimensional model. Calculations use lumped heat balances, specified glycol properties, assumed hydraulic resistance and a temperature-based COP estimate. Refrigerant flow and temperature glide require additional property data; heating shortfalls and auxiliary-heater demand are shown explicitly.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Vehicle thermal-management system</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;max-width:300px;padding:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#243140}\n#panel>div{margin:5px 0}h3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 7px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;margin:2px 1px}\nbutton:hover,button.active{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#stage,#status{font-size:11px}#error{position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;color:#b00020;text-align:center;background:#fff}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Whole-vehicle thermal management</h3>\n<div id=\"spec\"></div>\n<div id=\"modes\"></div>\n<div id=\"loads\"></div>\n<div id=\"flows\"></div>\n<div id=\"temps\"></div>\n<div id=\"power\"></div>\n<div id=\"balance\"></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:11px\">● <span style=\"color:#0f766e\">Battery</span> · <span style=\"color:#22c55e\">E-drive</span> · <span style=\"color:#2563eb\">Refrigerant</span> · Red: hot</div>\n<div><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button><button id=\"pause\">Pause</button><button id=\"reset\">Overview</button></div>\n<div id=\"stage\"></div>\n<div id=\"status\">Illustrative packaging; loading reference shell.</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\" hidden></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';\nconst P = {\n // Dimensions in mm; thermal inputs are editable engineering assumptions.\n voltage:800,capacity:100,charge:250,glycol:50,rho:1069,cp:3280,eta:.92,\n batteryFlow:12,driveFlow:15,batteryDp:45,driveDp:60,carnotFactor:.45,\n coolEvap:5,coolCond:55,heatEvap:-15,heatCond:50,recoveryEvap:5,\n approach:5,coolantIn:25,particles:36,particleRadius:12,flowSpeed:.055,\n shell:[4600,1450,1850],battery:[2100,170,1400],coldPlate:22,\n modes:[\n {label:'① Summer cooling',bat:2,mech:40,cabin:4,series:false,heat:false,ref:true,ambient:35},\n {label:'② Winter recovery',bat:.5,mech:25,cabin:5,series:true,heat:true,ref:true,ambient:-10,batteryDemand:3},\n {label:'③ Fast charge',bat:12,mech:0,cabin:0,series:false,heat:false,ref:true,ambient:35},\n {label:'④ Battery heating',bat:0,mech:25,cabin:0,series:true,heat:true,ref:false,ambient:-10,batteryDemand:3}\n ],\n parts:[\n ['battery','Battery + cold plate','Battery cooling plate',[-150,225,0],[2100,170,1400],'Collects cell heat through the underfloor cold plate.'],\n ['edrive','Front e-drive + oil cooler','Oil cooler',[1330,430,180],[460,300,620],'Transfers motor and inverter losses into coolant.'],\n ['itm','Integrated thermal module','Integrated thermal module',[780,410,-510],[420,260,400],'Packages pumps, nine-way valve and connecting manifolds.'],\n ['pump1','Battery pump','Electronic water pump',[680,445,-605],[95,110,95],'Circulates battery coolant; stops in series operation.'],\n ['pump2','E-drive / series pump','Electronic water pump',[885,445,-605],[95,110,95],'Drives the e-drive branch or combined series path.'],\n ['valve9','Nine-way coolant valve','Electronic coolant valve (multiport)',[780,455,-420],[140,140,140],'Selects parallel cooling or series recovery routes.'],\n ['chiller','Coolant–refrigerant chiller','Plate heat exchanger',[1070,420,-600],[200,210,160],'Cools the battery or extracts recovered coolant heat.'],\n ['condenser','Front micro-channel exchanger','Micro-channel heat exchanger',[2090,680,0],[65,540,1250],'Rejects summer heat; evaporates refrigerant in heat-pump mode.'],\n ['ltr','Low-temperature radiator + fan','Ancillary component',[1970,680,0],[70,540,1250],'Rejects e-drive heat when the radiator branch is enabled.'],\n ['compressor','Electric compressor','Ancillary component',[1570,520,-510],[230,250,240],'Raises refrigerant pressure and temperature.'],\n ['exv1','Cabin expansion valve','Electronic expansion valve',[1110,735,-300],[65,100,65],'Meters refrigerant to the cabin evaporator in cooling mode.'],\n ['exv2','Chiller expansion valve','Electronic expansion valve',[1160,460,-720],[65,100,65],'Meters the chiller branch; routing is schematic.'],\n ['hvac','Cabin HVAC assembly','Ancillary component',[850,830,140],[390,300,620],'Contains evaporator, heater core and heating-side condenser.'],\n ['ptc','Auxiliary coolant heater','Ancillary component',[760,690,-210],[210,95,160],'Supplies the battery heating shortfall after waste-heat recovery.']\n ],\n loops:[\n {id:'battery_loop',label:'Battery coolant',color:'#0f766e',radius:13,flow_lpm:12,closed:true,\n points:[[680,400,-600],[500,140,-620],[-1100,140,-620],[-1100,140,620],[780,140,620],[1070,380,-580],[780,400,-420]]},\n {id:'edrive_loop',label:'E-drive coolant',color:'#22c55e',radius:15,flow_lpm:15,closed:true,\n points:[[885,450,-600],[1330,430,180],[1710,380,580],[1970,650,550],[1970,920,-530],[1100,550,-820],[780,455,-420]]},\n {id:'refrigerant',label:'Refrigerant',color:'#2563eb',radius:9,flow_lpm:0,closed:true,\n points:[[1570,520,-510],[2110,430,-650],[2110,930,650],[1500,1000,700],[1110,735,-300],[850,850,140],[1160,460,-720],[1070,420,-600],[1380,340,-750]]}\n ],\n seriesPoints:[[885,450,-605],[1330,430,180],[1150,650,430],[760,690,-210],[780,455,-420],[780,140,620],[-1100,140,620],[-1100,140,-620],[500,140,-620],[680,445,-605],[1070,420,-600],[1000,350,-790]],\n stageParts:[['battery','edrive','hvac'],['itm','pump1','pump2','valve9'],['chiller','condenser','ltr','hvac','ptc'],['pump1','pump2','compressor']],\n colors:{al:'#d4d9e0',plastic:'#2b2b2b',electronic:'#1f4e79',fluid:'#3b82f6'}\n};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nfunction showError(message){$('error').hidden=false;$('error').textContent='Rendering error: '+message;}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\nconst scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\nconst renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\nrenderer.localClippingEnabled=true;document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\nscene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,.6));\nconst light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);light.position.set(1800,3500,1800);scene.add(light);\nconst camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\nconst controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\ncontrols.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;\ncontrols.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;transition=null;});\nconst modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\nconst car=new THREE.Group();car.name='car';scene.add(car);\nconst grid=new THREE.GridHelper(5600,28,0xd8d3cd,0xe8e3dc);grid.position.y=-10;scene.add(grid);\nconst parts={},sprites=[],covers=[],routes=[];\nlet modeIndex=0,stageIndex=0,paused=false,section=false,focused=null,transition=null,lastStage=0;\nconst vec=a=>new THREE.Vector3(...a);\nfunction material(color,opacity=1){return new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:.2,roughness:.6,transparent:opacity<1,opacity,depthWrite:opacity===1});}\nfunction box(group,size,pos,color,opacity=1){\n const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(...size),material(color,opacity));\n mesh.position.set(...pos);mesh.userData.baseOpacity=opacity;group.add(mesh);return mesh;\n}\nfunction cylinder(group,r,h,pos,color){\n const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(r,r,h,24),material(color));\n mesh.position.set(...pos);mesh.userData.baseOpacity=1;group.add(mesh);return mesh;\n}\nfunction badge(number){\n const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=64;canvas.height=64;\n const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');ctx.fillStyle='white';ctx.strokeStyle='#b11f4b';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(32,32,28,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.stroke();\n ctx.fillStyle='#243140';ctx.font='bold 28px Segoe UI';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';ctx.fillText(number,32,33);\n return new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas),depthTest:false}));\n}\nwindow.__hotspots=P.parts.map((p,i)=>({id:p[0],n:i+1,label:p[1],part:p[2],note:p[5]}));\nP.parts.forEach((p,i)=>{\n const [id,label,category,pos,size]=p,group=new THREE.Group();group.name=id;group.position.set(...pos);parts[id]=group;modelGroup.add(group);\n if(id==='battery'){\n  covers.push(box(group,size,[0,0,0],P.colors.al,.85));\n  box(group,[size[0],P.coldPlate,size[2]],[0,-size[1]/2-P.coldPlate/2,0],P.colors.fluid,.55);\n  for(let k=0;k<10;k++)box(group,[175,110,1250],[-900+k*200,0,0],P.colors.electronic);\n }else if(id==='itm'){\n  covers.push(box(group,size,[0,0,0],P.colors.al,.3));\n  box(group,[380,35,330],[0,-100,0],P.colors.electronic);\n }else if(id.startsWith('pump')||id==='compressor'||id==='valve9'||id.startsWith('exv')){\n  cylinder(group,size[0]/2,size[1],[0,0,0],id.startsWith('exv')?'#c9a227':P.colors.electronic);\n  if(id==='valve9')for(let k=0;k<9;k++){const a=k*Math.PI*2/9;box(group,[32,30,32],[86*Math.cos(a),-15,86*Math.sin(a)],P.colors.al);}\n }else{\n  covers.push(box(group,size,[0,0,0],id==='ptc'?P.colors.electronic:P.colors.al,.85));\n  if(id==='condenser'||id==='ltr'){\n   for(let k=0;k<24;k++)box(group,[size[0]+2,8,size[2]-20],[0,-240+k*20,0],P.colors.electronic);\n   if(id==='ltr'){const fan=cylinder(group,225,25,[-75,0,0],P.colors.plastic);fan.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;}\n  }else if(id==='edrive'){cylinder(group,130,400,[0,-15,0],P.colors.plastic);box(group,[320,65,330],[0,170,0],P.colors.electronic);}\n  else box(group,[size[0]*.8,size[1]*.55,size[2]*.8],[0,0,0],P.colors.fluid,.55);\n }\n const sprite=badge(i+1);sprite.position.set(0,size[1]/2+90,0);sprite.scale.set(85,85,1);sprite.userData.id=id;\n group.add(sprite);sprites.push(sprite);\n});\nconst curveOf=points=>new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(points.map(vec),true,'centripetal');\nconst matrix=new THREE.Matrix4(),hot=new THREE.Color('#dc2626');\nfunction createRoute(def,points=def.points){\n const curve=curveOf(points),geometry=new THREE.TubeGeometry(curve,180,def.radius,8,true);\n const tube=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material(def.color,.65));modelGroup.add(tube);\n const dots=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(P.particleRadius,8,6),material(def.color),P.particles);\n for(let i=0;i<P.particles;i++)dots.setMatrixAt(i,matrix.makeTranslation(...curve.getPointAt(i/P.particles).toArray()));\n dots.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;dots.computeBoundingSphere();modelGroup.add(dots);\n const route={id:def.id,curve,tube,dots,t:0,flow:def.flow_lpm,color:def.color,active:true};routes.push(route);return route;\n}\nP.loops.forEach(def=>createRoute(def));\nconst series=createRoute({...P.loops[0],id:'series',radius:15},P.seriesPoints);\nfunction compute(mode){\n const drive=mode.mech*(1-P.eta),flow=mode.series?P.driveFlow:P.batteryFlow;\n const batLoad=mode.heat?-(mode.batteryDemand||0):mode.bat;\n const cpFlow=P.rho*flow/60000*P.cp;\n const cop=P.carnotFactor*((mode.heat?P.heatCond:P.coolCond)+273.15)/\n ((mode.heat?P.heatCond:P.coolCond)-(mode.heat?P.recoveryEvap:P.coolEvap));\n const baseline=P.carnotFactor*(P.heatCond+273.15)/(P.heatCond-P.heatEvap);\n const recovered=Math.min(drive,mode.batteryDemand||0);\n const ptc=mode.heat?Math.max(0,(mode.batteryDemand||0)-recovered):0;\n const available=Math.max(0,drive-recovered)+mode.bat;\n const capacity=mode.ref?(mode.heat?mode.cabin:mode.bat+mode.cabin):0;\n const compressor=mode.ref?capacity/(mode.heat?cop:cop-1):0;\n const source=mode.heat?Math.max(0,capacity-compressor):0;\n const ambient=mode.heat?Math.max(0,source-available):0;\n const pump1=mode.series?0:P.batteryDp*1000*P.batteryFlow/60000;\n const pump2=(mode.series?P.batteryDp+P.driveDp:P.driveDp)*1000*P.driveFlow/60000;\n const dt=batLoad*1000/cpFlow,driveDt=drive*1000/(P.rho*P.driveFlow/60000*P.cp);\n const labels=['Battery-loop heat load (kW)','E-drive-loop heat load (kW)','Refrigerant-loop capacity (kW)','Total coolant flow (L/min)','Battery-loop ΔT (K)','Heat-pump COP (est.)'];\n const values=[batLoad,drive,capacity,mode.series?P.driveFlow:P.batteryFlow+P.driveFlow,dt,cop];\n const units=['kW','kW','kW','L/min','K',''];\n const metrics=labels.map((label,i)=>({label,value:values[i].toFixed(2),unit:units[i],note:'Use live page calculation as reference'}));\n return {metrics,drive,flow,dt,driveDt,cop,baseline,ptc,ambient,pump1,pump2,compressor,capacity};\n}\nfunction refresh(){\n const m=P.modes[modeIndex],r=compute(m);window.__metrics=r.metrics;\n $('spec').textContent=`${P.voltage} V · ${P.capacity} kWh · ${P.glycol}% glycol · R1234yf`;\n $('loads').textContent=`Heat B / E / refrigerant: ${r.metrics.slice(0,3).map(x=>x.value).join(' / ')} kW`;\n $('flows').textContent=`Flow B / E: ${r.flow} / ${P.driveFlow} L/min${m.series?' (same series stream)':' (parallel)'}; refrigerant: not solved`;\n $('temps').textContent=`ΔT B / E: ${r.dt.toFixed(2)} / ${r.driveDt.toFixed(2)} K; HX approach: ${P.approach} K assumed`;\n $('power').textContent=`Pump hydraulic B / E: ${r.pump1.toFixed(1)} / ${r.pump2.toFixed(1)} W; COP: ${r.cop.toFixed(2)}${!m.ref?' (off, potential)':''}`;\n $('balance').textContent=m.heat?`PTC ${r.ptc.toFixed(2)} kW; air-source need ${r.ambient.toFixed(2)} kW. COP ${r.baseline.toFixed(2)} → ${r.cop.toFixed(2)} assumes recovered-source temperature.`:`Compressor ${r.compressor.toFixed(2)} kW; cooling COP ${(r.cop-1).toFixed(2)}. ${modeIndex===2?P.charge+' kW charging. ':''}Refrigerant ΔT: not solved.`;\n $('modes').querySelectorAll('button').forEach((b,i)=>b.classList.toggle('active',i===modeIndex));\n routes.forEach(route=>{\n  route.active=route.id==='series'?m.series:route.id==='refrigerant'?m.ref:!m.series;\n  route.tube.visible=route.dots.visible=route.active;\n  route.flow=route.id==='refrigerant'?(m.heat?-1:1)*P.batteryFlow:route.id==='battery_loop'?P.batteryFlow:P.driveFlow;\n });\n parts.valve9.rotation.y=m.series?Math.PI/2:0;appearance();\n}\nfunction appearance(){\n const m=P.modes[modeIndex],selected=P.stageParts[stageIndex];\n Object.entries(parts).forEach(([id,g])=>g.traverse(o=>{\n  if(!o.isMesh)return;\n  const relevant=!focused||focused===id||(focused==='itm'&&['pump1','pump2','valve9'].includes(id));\n  o.material.opacity=relevant?(o.userData.baseOpacity??1):.25;o.material.transparent=o.material.opacity<1;\n  o.material.depthWrite=o.material.opacity===1;\n  const active=focused?relevant:selected.includes(id);\n  o.material.emissive.set(active?'#b11f4b':'#000000');o.material.emissiveIntensity=active?.25:0;\n  if(!focused&&((id==='pump1'&&m.series)||(id==='compressor'&&!m.ref)))o.material.emissiveIntensity=0;\n }));\n routes.forEach(r=>{r.tube.material.opacity=focused?.18:stageIndex===2?.45:.75;});\n}\nP.modes.forEach((m,i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=m.label;b.onclick=()=>{modeIndex=i;refresh();};$('modes').appendChild(b);});\nwindow.__stages=[\n {title:'Heat collection',text:'Battery, drive and cabin produce or require heat.'},\n {title:'Flow routing',text:'Valve and pumps select parallel or series flow.'},\n {title:'Heat exchange',text:'Chiller, front exchangers and HVAC transfer heat.'},\n {title:'Circulation',text:'Pumps and compressor sustain the selected cycle.'}\n];\nwindow.__setStage=i=>{\n stageIndex=((i%4)+4)%4;lastStage=performance.now();\n const s=window.__stages[stageIndex];$('stage').textContent=`Stage ${stageIndex+1}/4 · ${s.title}: ${s.text}`;\n appearance();if(typeof window.__notifyStage==='function')window.__notifyStage(stageIndex);\n};\nconst bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true),center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3());\nconst size=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()),direction=vec([1,.7,1.2]).normalize();\nfunction globalPosition(){\n const angle=Math.min(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(40),2*Math.atan(Math.tan(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(20))*camera.aspect));\n return center.clone().addScaledVector(direction,size.length()/(2*Math.sin(angle/2))/.70);\n}\nlet overview=globalPosition();camera.position.copy(overview);controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\nwindow.__focus=id=>{\n if(id!==null&&!parts[id])return;focused=id;controls.autoRotate=false;\n const b=id?new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(parts[id],true):bounds;\n const target=id?b.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()):center.clone();\n const distance=id?Math.max(...b.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()).toArray())*2.5:0;\n transition={start:performance.now(),from:camera.position.clone(),to:id?target.clone().addScaledVector(direction,distance):overview.clone(),a:controls.target.clone(),b:target};\n appearance();\n};\nconst raycaster=new THREE.Raycaster(),pointer=new THREE.Vector2();let down=null;\nrenderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{down=[e.clientX,e.clientY];});\nrenderer.domElement.addEventListener('pointerup',e=>{\n if(!down||Math.hypot(e.clientX-down[0],e.clientY-down[1])>5)return;\n pointer.set(e.clientX/innerWidth*2-1,1-e.clientY/innerHeight*2);raycaster.setFromCamera(pointer,camera);\n const hits=raycaster.intersectObjects(sprites);if(hits.length)window.__focus(hits[0].object.userData.id);\n});\n$('section').onclick=()=>{section=!section;covers.forEach(o=>o.visible=!section);car.visible=!section;$('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';};\n$('rotate').onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;};\n$('pause').onclick=()=>{paused=!paused;lastStage=performance.now();$('pause').textContent=paused?'Continue':'Pause';};\n$('reset').onclick=()=>window.__focus(null);\nwindow.addEventListener('resize',()=>{camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);overview=globalPosition();});\nrefresh();window.__setStage(0);\nwindow.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\nnew GLTFLoader().load('/static/assets/car/sedan.glb',gltf=>{\n gltf.scene.traverse(o=>{\n  if(!o.isMesh)return;\n  let node=o,isBody=false,isWheel=false;\n  while(node){isBody=isBody||node.name.startsWith('body');isWheel=isWheel||node.name.startsWith('wheel_');node=node.parent;}\n  if(isBody&&!isWheel)o.material=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#9fb4d8',transparent:true,opacity:.12,depthWrite:false,side:THREE.DoubleSide,metalness:.2,roughness:.6});\n  if(isWheel)o.material=material('#2b2b2b');\n });car.add(gltf.scene);$('status').textContent='Generic shell, not SUV geometry. Paths show connectivity, not valve port design.';\n},undefined,()=>{\n const fallback=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(...P.shell),new THREE.MeshBasicMaterial({color:'#9fb4d8',wireframe:true,transparent:true,opacity:.15}));\n fallback.position.y=P.shell[1]/2;car.add(fallback);$('status').textContent='Shell unavailable: wireframe envelope. Refrigerant split and COP are schematic assumptions.';\n});\nlet previous=performance.now();\nfunction animate(now){\n requestAnimationFrame(animate);const dt=Math.min((now-previous)/1000,.05);previous=now;\n if(!paused&&now-lastStage>5000)window.__setStage(stageIndex+1);\n routes.forEach(r=>{\n  if(!r.active)return;r.t=(r.t+dt*P.flowSpeed*r.flow/P.batteryFlow+1)%1;\n  for(let i=0;i<P.particles;i++){\n   const u=(r.t+i/P.particles)%1,point=r.curve.getPointAt(u);\n   r.dots.setMatrixAt(i,matrix.makeTranslation(point.x,point.y,point.z));\n   const heat=Math.max(0,Math.sin(u*Math.PI*2));\n   r.dots.setColorAt(i,new THREE.Color(r.color).lerp(hot,heat*.85));\n  }\n  r.dots.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;if(r.dots.instanceColor)r.dots.instanceColor.needsUpdate=true;r.dots.computeBoundingSphere();\n });\n if(transition){\n  const t=Math.min((now-transition.start)/600,1),s=t*t*(3-2*t);\n  camera.position.lerpVectors(transition.from,transition.to,s);controls.target.lerpVectors(transition.a,transition.b,s);\n  if(t===1)transition=null;\n }\n controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);\n}\nrequestAnimationFrame(animate);\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Battery-loop heat load (kW)", "value": "2.00", "unit": "kW", "note": "Use live page calculation as reference"}, {"label": "E-drive-loop heat load (kW)", "value": "3.20", "unit": "kW", "note": "Use live page calculation as reference"}, {"label": "Refrigerant-loop capacity (kW)", "value": "6.00", "unit": "kW", "note": "Use live page calculation as reference"}, {"label": "Total coolant flow (L/min)", "value": "27.00", "unit": "L/min", "note": "Use live page calculation as reference"}, {"label": "Battery-loop ΔT (K)", "value": "2.85", "unit": "K", "note": "Use live page calculation as reference"}, {"label": "Heat-pump COP (est.)", "value": "2.95", "unit": "", "note": "Use live page calculation as reference"}], "suggestions": ["Add refrigerant property calculations and separate cabin and chiller branches.", "Compare winter heating energy with and without e-drive waste-heat recovery.", "Replace illustrative packaging with SUV dimensions and validate nine-way valve port connections."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nBuilt an interactive whole-vehicle thermal-management schematic for an electric SUV, including the underfloor battery cold plate, front e-drive and oil cooler, integrated coolant module, cabin HVAC, front heat exchangers, compressor, chiller, expansion valves and auxiliary heater. Animated coolant and refrigerant paths switch between parallel cooling and series waste-heat recovery across the requested operating modes. Numbered hotspots, sectional visibility and staged narration support system review. Component geometry uses illustrative proportions; the optional transparent vehicle shell is a generic packaging reference, not an SUV dimensional model. Calculations use lumped heat balances, specified glycol properties, assumed hydraulic resistance and a temperature-based COP estimate. Refrigerant flow and temperature glide require additional property data; heating shortfalls and auxiliary-heater demand are shown explicitly.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Vehicle thermal-management system</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;max-width:300px;padding:11px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#243140}\n#panel>div{margin:5px 0}h3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 7px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;margin:2px 1px}\nbutton:hover,button.active{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#stage,#status{font-size:11px}#error{position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;right:15%;color:#b00020;text-align:center;background:#fff}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>Whole-vehicle thermal management</h3>\n<div id=\"spec\"></div>\n<div id=\"modes\"></div>\n<div id=\"loads\"></div>\n<div id=\"flows\"></div>\n<div id=\"temps\"></div>\n<div id=\"power\"></div>\n<div id=\"balance\"></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:11px\">● <span style=\"color:#0f766e\">Battery</span> · <span style=\"color:#22c55e\">E-drive</span> · <span style=\"color:#2563eb\">Refrigerant</span> · Red: hot</div>\n<div><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate</button><button id=\"pause\">Pause</button><button id=\"reset\">Overview</button></div>\n<div id=\"stage\"></div>\n<div id=\"status\">Illustrative packaging; loading reference shell.</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\" hidden></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';\nconst P = {\n // Dimensions in mm; thermal inputs are editable engineering assumptions.\n voltage:800,capacity:100,charge:250,glycol:50,rho:1069,cp:3280,eta:.92,\n batteryFlow:12,driveFlow:15,batteryDp:45,driveDp:60,carnotFactor:.45,\n coolEvap:5,coolCond:55,heatEvap:-15,heatCond:50,recoveryEvap:5,\n approach:5,coolantIn:25,particles:36,particleRadius:12,flowSpeed:.055,\n shell:[4600,1450,1850],battery:[2100,170,1400],coldPlate:22,\n modes:[\n {label:'① Summer cooling',bat:2,mech:40,cabin:4,series:false,heat:false,ref:true,ambient:35},\n {label:'② Winter recovery',bat:.5,mech:25,cabin:5,series:true,heat:true,ref:true,ambient:-10,batteryDemand:3},\n {label:'③ Fast charge',bat:12,mech:0,cabin:0,series:false,heat:false,ref:true,ambient:35},\n {label:'④ Battery heating',bat:0,mech:25,cabin:0,series:true,heat:true,ref:false,ambient:-10,batteryDemand:3}\n ],\n parts:[\n ['battery','Battery + cold plate','Battery cooling plate',[-150,225,0],[2100,170,1400],'Collects cell heat through the underfloor cold plate.'],\n ['edrive','Front e-drive + oil cooler','Oil cooler',[1330,430,180],[460,300,620],'Transfers motor and inverter losses into coolant.'],\n ['itm','Integrated thermal module','Integrated thermal module',[780,410,-510],[420,260,400],'Packages pumps, nine-way valve and connecting manifolds.'],\n ['pump1','Battery pump','Electronic water pump',[680,445,-605],[95,110,95],'Circulates battery coolant; stops in series operation.'],\n ['pump2','E-drive / series pump','Electronic water pump',[885,445,-605],[95,110,95],'Drives the e-drive branch or combined series path.'],\n ['valve9','Nine-way coolant valve','Electronic coolant valve (multiport)',[780,455,-420],[140,140,140],'Selects parallel cooling or series recovery routes.'],\n ['chiller','Coolant–refrigerant chiller','Plate heat exchanger',[1070,420,-600],[200,210,160],'Cools the battery or extracts recovered coolant heat.'],\n ['condenser','Front micro-channel exchanger','Micro-channel heat exchanger',[2090,680,0],[65,540,1250],'Rejects summer heat; evaporates refrigerant in heat-pump mode.'],\n ['ltr','Low-temperature radiator + fan','Ancillary component',[1970,680,0],[70,540,1250],'Rejects e-drive heat when the radiator branch is enabled.'],\n ['compressor','Electric compressor','Ancillary component',[1570,520,-510],[230,250,240],'Raises refrigerant pressure and temperature.'],\n ['exv1','Cabin expansion valve','Electronic expansion valve',[1110,735,-300],[65,100,65],'Meters refrigerant to the cabin evaporator in cooling mode.'],\n ['exv2','Chiller expansion valve','Electronic expansion valve',[1160,460,-720],[65,100,65],'Meters the chiller branch; routing is schematic.'],\n ['hvac','Cabin HVAC assembly','Ancillary component',[850,830,140],[390,300,620],'Contains evaporator, heater core and heating-side condenser.'],\n ['ptc','Auxiliary coolant heater','Ancillary component',[760,690,-210],[210,95,160],'Supplies the battery heating shortfall after waste-heat recovery.']\n ],\n loops:[\n {id:'battery_loop',label:'Battery coolant',color:'#0f766e',radius:13,flow_lpm:12,closed:true,\n points:[[680,400,-600],[500,140,-620],[-1100,140,-620],[-1100,140,620],[780,140,620],[1070,380,-580],[780,400,-420]]},\n {id:'edrive_loop',label:'E-drive coolant',color:'#22c55e',radius:15,flow_lpm:15,closed:true,\n points:[[885,450,-600],[1330,430,180],[1710,380,580],[1970,650,550],[1970,920,-530],[1100,550,-820],[780,455,-420]]},\n {id:'refrigerant',label:'Refrigerant',color:'#2563eb',radius:9,flow_lpm:0,closed:true,\n points:[[1570,520,-510],[2110,430,-650],[2110,930,650],[1500,1000,700],[1110,735,-300],[850,850,140],[1160,460,-720],[1070,420,-600],[1380,340,-750]]}\n ],\n seriesPoints:[[885,450,-605],[1330,430,180],[1150,650,430],[760,690,-210],[780,455,-420],[780,140,620],[-1100,140,620],[-1100,140,-620],[500,140,-620],[680,445,-605],[1070,420,-600],[1000,350,-790]],\n stageParts:[['battery','edrive','hvac'],['itm','pump1','pump2','valve9'],['chiller','condenser','ltr','hvac','ptc'],['pump1','pump2','compressor']],\n colors:{al:'#d4d9e0',plastic:'#2b2b2b',electronic:'#1f4e79',fluid:'#3b82f6'}\n};\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nfunction showError(message){$('error').hidden=false;$('error').textContent='Rendering error: '+message;}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry {\nconst scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\nconst renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\nrenderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\nrenderer.localClippingEnabled=true;document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\nscene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,.6));\nconst light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);light.position.set(1800,3500,1800);scene.add(light);\nconst camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\nconst controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\ncontrols.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1;\ncontrols.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;transition=null;});\nconst modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\nconst car=new THREE.Group();car.name='car';scene.add(car);\nconst grid=new THREE.GridHelper(5600,28,0xd8d3cd,0xe8e3dc);grid.position.y=-10;scene.add(grid);\nconst parts={},sprites=[],covers=[],routes=[];\nlet modeIndex=0,stageIndex=0,paused=false,section=false,focused=null,transition=null,lastStage=0;\nconst vec=a=>new THREE.Vector3(...a);\nfunction material(color,opacity=1){return new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:.2,roughness:.6,transparent:opacity<1,opacity,depthWrite:opacity===1});}\nfunction box(group,size,pos,color,opacity=1){\n const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(...size),material(color,opacity));\n mesh.position.set(...pos);mesh.userData.baseOpacity=opacity;group.add(mesh);return mesh;\n}\nfunction cylinder(group,r,h,pos,color){\n const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(r,r,h,24),material(color));\n mesh.position.set(...pos);mesh.userData.baseOpacity=1;group.add(mesh);return mesh;\n}\nfunction badge(number){\n const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=64;canvas.height=64;\n const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');ctx.fillStyle='white';ctx.strokeStyle='#b11f4b';ctx.lineWidth=1;\n ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(32,32,28,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.stroke();\n ctx.fillStyle='#243140';ctx.font='bold 28px Segoe UI';ctx.textAlign='center';ctx.textBaseline='middle';ctx.fillText(number,32,33);\n return new THREE.Sprite(new THREE.SpriteMaterial({map:new THREE.CanvasTexture(canvas),depthTest:false}));\n}\nwindow.__hotspots=P.parts.map((p,i)=>({id:p[0],n:i+1,label:p[1],part:p[2],note:p[5]}));\nP.parts.forEach((p,i)=>{\n const [id,label,category,pos,size]=p,group=new THREE.Group();group.name=id;group.position.set(...pos);parts[id]=group;modelGroup.add(group);\n if(id==='battery'){\n  covers.push(box(group,size,[0,0,0],P.colors.al,.85));\n  box(group,[size[0],P.coldPlate,size[2]],[0,-size[1]/2-P.coldPlate/2,0],P.colors.fluid,.55);\n  for(let k=0;k<10;k++)box(group,[175,110,1250],[-900+k*200,0,0],P.colors.electronic);\n }else if(id==='itm'){\n  covers.push(box(group,size,[0,0,0],P.colors.al,.3));\n  box(group,[380,35,330],[0,-100,0],P.colors.electronic);\n }else if(id.startsWith('pump')||id==='compressor'||id==='valve9'||id.startsWith('exv')){\n  cylinder(group,size[0]/2,size[1],[0,0,0],id.startsWith('exv')?'#c9a227':P.colors.electronic);\n  if(id==='valve9')for(let k=0;k<9;k++){const a=k*Math.PI*2/9;box(group,[32,30,32],[86*Math.cos(a),-15,86*Math.sin(a)],P.colors.al);}\n }else{\n  covers.push(box(group,size,[0,0,0],id==='ptc'?P.colors.electronic:P.colors.al,.85));\n  if(id==='condenser'||id==='ltr'){\n   for(let k=0;k<24;k++)box(group,[size[0]+2,8,size[2]-20],[0,-240+k*20,0],P.colors.electronic);\n   if(id==='ltr'){const fan=cylinder(group,225,25,[-75,0,0],P.colors.plastic);fan.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;}\n  }else if(id==='edrive'){cylinder(group,130,400,[0,-15,0],P.colors.plastic);box(group,[320,65,330],[0,170,0],P.colors.electronic);}\n  else box(group,[size[0]*.8,size[1]*.55,size[2]*.8],[0,0,0],P.colors.fluid,.55);\n }\n const sprite=badge(i+1);sprite.position.set(0,size[1]/2+90,0);sprite.scale.set(85,85,1);sprite.userData.id=id;\n group.add(sprite);sprites.push(sprite);\n});\nconst curveOf=points=>new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3(points.map(vec),true,'centripetal');\nconst matrix=new THREE.Matrix4(),hot=new THREE.Color('#dc2626');\nfunction createRoute(def,points=def.points){\n const curve=curveOf(points),geometry=new THREE.TubeGeometry(curve,180,def.radius,8,true);\n const tube=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material(def.color,.65));modelGroup.add(tube);\n const dots=new THREE.InstancedMesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(P.particleRadius,8,6),material(def.color),P.particles);\n for(let i=0;i<P.particles;i++)dots.setMatrixAt(i,matrix.makeTranslation(...curve.getPointAt(i/P.particles).toArray()));\n dots.instanceMatrix.needsUpdate=true;dots.computeBoundingSphere();modelGroup.add(dots);\n const route={id:def.id,curve,tube,dots,t:0,flow:def.flow_lpm,color:def.color,active:true};routes.push(route);return route;\n}\nP.loops.forEach(def=>createRoute(def));\nconst series=createRoute({...P.loops[0],id:'series',radius:15},P.seriesPoints);\nfunction compute(mode){\n const drive=mode.mech*(1-P.eta),flow=mode.series?P.driveFlow:P.batteryFlow;\n const batLoad=mode.heat?-(mode.batteryDemand||0):mode.bat;\n const cpFlow=P.rho*flow/60000*P.cp;\n const cop=P.carnotFactor*((mode.heat?P.heatCond:P.coolCond)+273.15)/\n ((mode.heat?P.heatCond:P.coolCond)-(mode.heat?P.recoveryEvap:P.coolEvap));\n const baseline=P.carnotFactor*(P.heatCond+273.15)/(P.heatCond-P.heatEvap);\n const recovered=Math.min(drive,mode.batteryDemand||0);\n const ptc=mode.heat?Math.max(0,(mode.batteryDemand||0)-recovered):0;\n const available=Math.max(0,drive-recovered)+mode.bat;\n const capacity=mode.ref?(mode.heat?mode.cabin:mode.bat+mode.cabin):0;\n const compressor=mode.ref?capacity/(mode.heat?cop:cop-1):0;\n const source=mode.heat?Math.max(0,capacity-compressor):0;\n const ambient=mode.heat?Math.max(0,source-available):0;\n const pump1=mode.series?0:P.batteryDp*1000*P.batteryFlow/60000;\n const pump2=(mode.series?P.batteryDp+P.driveDp:P.driveDp)*1000*P.driveFlow/60000;\n const dt=batLoad*1000/cpFlow,driveDt=drive*1000/(P.rho*P.driveFlow/60000*P.cp);\n const labels=['Battery-loop heat load (kW)','E-drive-loop heat load (kW)','Refrigerant-loop c